{#
    Email 05, "Your Lumen Forma is on its way" (Site v4 design, Llunio Email
    Templates/05-dispatched.html), sent when the studio marks the order
    Dispatched (Step 11.3): "Dear {first name}," (the buyer's), "Your Lumen
    Forma {sizes} lamp has left the studio and is on its way to you." and
    "We hope it's even better in person, and we'd love to hear what you think
    once it arrives." (wording decided 9 October 2026, replacing the design's
    sentence; the photo request moved to email 06), 01 Delivery (order number, courier, tracking number), "Track
    your delivery" (DPD's tracking page; none for Palletways) and "View your
    order". Laid out by email/_customer.html.twig (the email rules).
#}
{% extends 'email/_customer.html.twig' %}
{% import 'email/_customer.html.twig' as layout %}

{% block title %}Your Lumen Forma is on its way{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}Order {{ order.orderNumber }} has left the studio with {{ order.courier.label }}.{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<p style="{{ body }}">{{ order.onItsWaySentence }}</p>
<p style="{{ body }}">We hope it's even better in person, and we'd love to hear what you think once it arrives.</p>
{{ layout.section('01', 'Delivery') }}
<p style="{{ label }}">Order number</p>
<p style="{{ body }}">{{ order.orderNumber }}</p>
<p style="{{ label }}">Courier</p>
<p style="{{ body }}" data-email-courier>{{ order.courier.label }}</p>
<p style="{{ label }}">Tracking number</p>
<p style="{{ body }}" data-email-tracking>{{ order.trackingNumber }}</p>
<div style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:1px;">&nbsp;</div>
{% if order.trackingUrl %}
    {{ layout.button(order.trackingUrl, 'Track your delivery') }}
    <div style="height:16px;line-height:16px;font-size:1px;">&nbsp;</div>
{% endif %}
{{ layout.button(url('order_view', { token: order.viewToken }), 'View your order') }}
<div style="height:24px;line-height:24px;font-size:1px;">&nbsp;</div>
<p style="{{ body }}">Reply to this email with any questions.</p>
{% endblock %}
